sequenceDiagram
    actor Reader
    participant UI as ReservationUI
    participant Service as ReservationService
    participant Copy as BookCopy

    Note over Reader,UI: Precondition: Reader is registered

    Reader->>UI: selectBook(bookId)
    activate UI

    Reader->>UI: submitReservation(bookId)

    UI->>Service: createReservationRequest(readerId, bookId)
    activate Service

    Service->>Service: validateReservationRequest(readerId, bookId)

    loop For each physical copy of the selected book
        Service->>Copy: checkAvailability(copyId)
        activate Copy
        Copy-->>Service: status = unavailable
        deactivate Copy
    end

    break No available copies
        Service-->>UI: rejectReservation()
        UI-->>Reader: displayNoCopiesMessage()
    end

    deactivate Service
    deactivate UI